 real storage write capability.","locale":"en"},"481":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio-20","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/fio#21-write-test","content":"Execution command:","locale":"en"},"482":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio-21","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/fio#22-256k-sequential-read-test","content":"Test purpose: verify the 256k sequential read performance of a 100G large file under different thread counts. The test duration is 60 seconds, kernel cache is bypassed, and the focus is on observing how bandwidth changes with the number of threads.","locale":"en"},"483":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio-22","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/fio#22-256k-sequential-read-test","content":"Execution command:","locale":"en"},"484":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio-23","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/fio#22-256k-sequential-read-test","content":"Test results, corresponding relationship between thread count and read speed:","locale":"en"},"485":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio-24","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/fio#22-256k-sequential-read-test","content":"| Thread Count | Read Speed (GiB/s) |\n| ------------ | ------------------ |\n| 1            | 2.1                |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"486":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio-25","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/fio#22-256k-sequential-read-test","content":"| Thread Count | Read Speed (GiB/s) |\n| ------------ | ------------------ |\n| 2            | 3.7                |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"487":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio-26","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/fio","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/fio#22-256k-sequential-read-test","content":"| Thread Count | Read Speed (GiB/s) |\n| ------------ | ------------------ |\n| 4            | 6.1             