| `file_name` | empty   | Base log file name; empty means `curvine` |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-311","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field           | Default | Meaning               |\n| --------------- | ------- | --------------------- |\n| `max_log_files` | `10`    | Rotated files to keep |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-312","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                                                |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `max_file_size_mb` | `100`   | Size-based rotation threshold; `0` means no size limit |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-313","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field           | Default | Meaning                                                 |\n| --------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `time_rotation` | empty   | `daily` or `hourly`; empty means no time-based rotation |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-314","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field            | Default | Meaning                  