_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field           | Default  | Meaning               |\n| --------------- | -------- | --------------------- |\n| `job_max_files` | `100000` | Maximum files per job |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-324","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                             | Default | Meaning                                   |\n| --------------------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `master_max_concurrent_load_jobs` | `16`    | Concurrent Master-side load planning jobs |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-325","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                             | Default | Meaning                              |\n| --------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `master_max_background_load_jobs` | `1024`  | Background load jobs allowed to wait |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-326","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                                 | Default | Meaning                                  |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `master_max_pending_load_job_submits` | `4096`  | Pending submit requests before admission |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-327","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                             | Default | Meaning                                    |\n| --------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `master_load_job_runtime_threads` | `4`     | Runtime threads reserved for load planning |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-328","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                              | Default | Meaning                                     |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `master_load_job_blocking_threads` | `16`    | Blocking threads reserved for load planning |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-329","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                                   | Default | Meaning                                                  |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `master_failed_load_job_retry_interval` | `30s`   | Reuse window for deterministic source-not-found failures |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-330","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text