buted-Mode/conf-334","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                                                                                                                              |\n| --------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `enabled` | `false` | Enable Transfer routing in this process. On a client, `load` and `export` use Transfer; on a Transfer server, it starts the service. |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-335","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field       | Default                                                 | Meaning                                                                                                                                                                |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `store_url` | empty; inferred as `sqlite://data/transfer/transfer.db` | State store URL. Schemes: `memory://`, `sqlite://`, `mysql://`, `postgres://`, `postgresql://`. Use one shared `mysql://` or `postgres://` URL for multiple instances. |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-336","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field      | Default     | Meaning                                                            |\n| ---------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `hostname` | `localhost` | RPC and web bind hostname when explicit endpoints are not supplied |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-337","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field      | Default | Meaning           |\n| ---------- | ------- | ----------------- |\n| `rpc_port` | `9010`  | Transfer RPC port |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-338","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field      | Default | Meaning                      |\n| ---------- | ------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `web_port` | `9011`  | Health and metrics HTTP port |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-339","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field       | Default                     | Meaning                                                                      |\n| ----------- | --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `endpoints` | `[\"<hostname>:<rpc_port>\"]` | Client-facing Transfer RPC addresses; use a Service or load-balancer address |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-340","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field         | Default | Meaning                                                          |\n| ------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `instance_id` | empty   | Optional stable service owner ID; a UUID is generated when empty |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-341","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field                   | Default | Meaning                                          |\n| ----------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `max_running_transfers` | `64`    | Maximum jobs this instance executes concurrently |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-342","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field                       | Default | Meaning                                                          |\n| --------------------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `client_pending_queue_size` | `1024`  | Maximum auto-cache requests waiting for or performing submission |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-343","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field                       | Default | Meaning                                             