istributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field           | Default | Meaning                                                                    |\n| --------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `lease_timeout` | `120s`  | Ownership lease duration used for recovery and multi-instance coordination |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-348","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field                | Default | Meaning                                                   |\n| -------------------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `terminal_retention` | `168h`  | Retention for completed, failed, and canceled job records |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-349","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field | Default        | Meaning             |\n| ----- | -------------- | ------------------- |\n| `log` | `transfer.log` | Transfer log config |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-350","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"Do not use the deprecated inputs `store_type`, `sqlite_path`, or `mysql_url` in new configurations. `store_url` selects the backend from its scheme. Internal queue, probe, and scheduler values are not part of the supported user configuration surface.","locale":"en"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distri