de/k8s-Deployment-61","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"`openKruise.enabled` defaults to `false`. Master and worker use standard `apps/v1` StatefulSets.","locale":"en"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-62","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"Set `openKruise.enabled=true` to install the kruise subchart and switch master/worker to Advanced StatefulSet (`apps.kruise.io/v1beta1`).","locale":"en"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-63","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"| Parameter            | Default | Description                 |\n| -------------------- | ------- | --------------------------- |\n| `openKruise.enabled` | `false` | Enable Advanced StatefulSet |","locale":"en","table":"table-5"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-64","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"| Parameter                    | Default       | Description                                        |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `openKruise.podUpdatePolicy` | `InPlaceOnly` | `InPlaceOnly` \\| `InPlaceIfPossible` \\| `ReCreate` |","locale":"en","table":"table-5"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-65","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"| Parameter                                    | Default | Description                      |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `openKruise.persistentPodState.autoGenerate` | `true`  | Auto-generate PersistentPodState |","locale":"en","table":"table-5"},"1361":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-66","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"| Parameter                                                   | Default                  | Description            |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| `openKruise.persistentPodState.preferredPersistentTopology` | `kubernetes.io/hostname` | Preferred topology key |","locale":"en","table":"table-5"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-67","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#openkruise","content":"| Parameter                                                  | Default | Description                      |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `openKruise.persistentPodState.requiredPersistentTopology` | `\"\"`    | Required topology key (optional) |","locale":"en","table":"table-5"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-68","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distribut