/small-file-read-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-cache-mode-测试流程","content":"挂载 Curvine 至指定目录：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3942":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-cache-mode-测试流程","content":"读取测试命令：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3943":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-cache-mode-测试流程","content":"元数据缓存优化测试：分别开启内核元数据缓存、客户端元数据缓存、双缓存。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3944":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#四测试结果","content":"| 测试类型           | 处理速度（张/秒） | 性能提升对比（与 MinIO 冷读） |\n| -------------- | --------- | ------------------ |\n| MinIO 原生冷读（基准） | 1675      | -                  |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3945":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#四测试结果","content":"| 测试类型        | 处理速度（张/秒） | 性能提升对比（与 MinIO 冷读） |\n| ----------- | --------- | ------------------ |\n| Curvine 基础版 | 5615      | +235.2%            |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3946":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#四测试结果","content":"| 测试类型              | 处理速度（张/秒） | 性能提升对比（与 MinIO 冷读） |\n| ----------------- | --------- | ------------------ |\n| Curvine + 内核元数据缓存 | 5997      | +257.9%            |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3947":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"