anuals/Access/s3-gateway-67","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#路径映射","content":"Bucket 就是普通的 Curvine 目录，对象就是普通文件。上传对象前必须先创建 bucket；也可以通过 FUSE、CLI 或 SDK 访问这些路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5527":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#1-构建网关","content":"二进制文件输出到 `target/release/curvine-s3-gateway`。发行包目前尚未包含该二进制，请从构建输出目录运行，或将其复制到网关所在机器。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5528":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#2-配置集群连接","content":"网关复用常规的 Curvine 集群配置文件。为网关相关设置添加 `[s3_gateway]` 部分；`[client]`、`[master]` 等其他部分用于连接集群：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5529":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#2-配置集群连接","content":"所有选项见 配置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5530":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#3-创建凭据","content":"网关没有内置的默认凭据。请生成密钥对并写入凭据存储：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5531":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#3-创建凭据","content":"或注册已有的密钥对（access key 长度必须为 16–32 个字符，secret key 为 16–64 个字符）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5532":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#3-创建凭据","content":"以上命令使用配置文件所选的凭据存储。详见 凭据管理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5533":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#4-启动网关","content":"默认监听地址为 `0.0.0.0:9900`。可以在命令行覆盖监听地址和 region：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5534":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-75","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#4-启动网关","content":"仅当 `--listen` 和 `--region` 的取值不同于内置默认值（`0.0.0.0:9900` 和 `us-east-1`）时，它们才会覆盖配置文件中的值。这两个值请使用配置文件设置，或在命令行显式传入不同的值。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5535":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-76","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数       | 描述             | 默认值                        |\n| -------- | -------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `--conf` | Curvine 集群配置文件 | `etc/curvine-cluster.toml` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5536":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-77","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数         | 描述                | 默认值            |\n| ---------- | ----------------- | -------------- |\n| `--listen` | 监听地址（`host:port`） | `0.0.0.0:9900` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5537":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-78","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数         | 描述           | 默认值         |\n| ---------- | ------------ | ----------- |\n| `--region` | S3 region 标识 | `us-east-1` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5538":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-79","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数                   | 描述       | 默认值                |\n| -------------------- | -------- | ------------------ |\n| `--credentials-path` | 覆盖凭据存储路径 | `[s3_gateway]` 中的值 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5539":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-80","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数      | 描述                 | 默认值 |\n| ------- | ------------------ | --- |\n| `serve` | 可选子命令；不带子命令时直接启动服务 | —   |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5540":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-81","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令行参数","content":"| 参数                                      | 描述      | 默认值 |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------- | --- |\n| `credential add\\|generate\\|list\\|stats` | 凭据管理子命令 | —   |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"5541":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-82","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数       | 类型     | 默认值              | 描述      |\n| -------- | ------ | ---------------- | ------- |\n| `listen` | string | `\"0.0.0.0:9900\"` | 监听地址和端口 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5542":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-83","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数       | 类型     | 默认值           | 描述           |\n| -------- | ------ | ------------- | ------------ |\n| `region` | string | `\"us-east-1\"` | S3 region 标识 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5543":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-84","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数             | 类型     | 默认值                   | 描述                             |\n| -------------- | ------ | --------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `put_temp_dir` | string | `\"/tmp/curvine-temp\"` | 本地存储模式下 PUT 操作（普通上传和分片上传）的临时目录 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5544":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-85","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                            | 类型      | 默认值       | 描述                      |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | --------- | ----------------------- |\n| `put_memory_buffer_threshold` | integer | `1048576` | PUT 时小于该大小（字节）的对象缓存在内存中 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5545":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-86","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                      | 类型      | 默认值        | 描述                  |\n| ----------------------- | ------- | ---------- | ------------------- |\n| `put_max_memory_buffer` | integer | `16777216` | PUT 时内存缓冲区的最大大小（字节） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5546":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-87","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                  | 类型    | 默认值   | 描述               |\n| ------------------- | ----- | ----- | ---------------- |\n| `get_chunk_size_mb` | float | `1.0` | GET 响应的读写块大小（MB） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5547":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-88","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                        | 类型      | 默认值     | 描述                         |\n| ------------------------- | ------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `enable_distributed_auth` | boolean | `false` | 将凭据存储在 Curvine 中，而不是本地文件系统 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5548":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-89","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                 | 类型     | 默认值 | 描述     |\n| ------------------ | ------ | --- | ------ |\n| `credentials_path` | string | 见下文 | 凭据存储路径 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5549":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-90","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"| 参数                            | 类型      | 默认值  | 描述          |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | ---- | ----------- |\n| `cache_refresh_interval_secs` | integer | `30` | 凭据缓存刷新间隔（秒） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-5"},"5550":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-91","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"`[worker]` 部分的 `worker.enable_s3_gateway` 用于启用分布式分片存储：分片数据写入 Curvine 的 `/.s3temp`，而不是 `put_temp_dir`，因此任意网关实例都可以完成上传。设置该项也会使二进制切换到分布式凭据存储。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5551":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-92","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"**凭据存储路径：**","locale":"zh-cn"},"5552":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-93","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"本地模式（`enable_distributed_auth = false`）：默认 `~/.curvine/credentials.jsonl`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5553":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-94","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"分布式模式（`enable_distributed_auth = true`）：默认 `/system/auth/credentials.jsonl`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5554":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-95","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#s3_gateway-配置","content":"**配置示例：**","locale":"zh-cn"},"5555":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-96","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#凭据管理","content":"凭据以 JSONL 格式存储，每行一个条目：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5556":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-97","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#环境变量","content":"| 变量                                         | 描述         |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ---------- |\n| `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` 或 `CURVINE_ACCESS_KEY` | Access key |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"5557":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-98","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#环境变量","content":"| 变量                                             | 描述         |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ---------- |\n| `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY` 或 `CURVINE_SECRET_KEY` | Secret key |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"5558":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-99","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#环境变量","content":"| 变量         | 描述                                                       |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `RUST_LOG` | 日志级别（例如 `info`、`debug`、`curvine_s3_gateway::auth=debug`） |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"5559":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-100","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#环境变量","content":"仅当配置的凭据存储为空时，网关才会导入环境变量中的凭据；导入的密钥对会写入本地凭据存储。如果既没有已存储的凭据，也没有环境变量凭据，网关将以空存储启动，并拒绝所有请求。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5560":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-101","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#命令","content":"`credential list --show-secrets` 和 `credential generate` 会将 secret key 打印到终端。请将该输出视为敏感信息，避免写入 shell 历史或共享日志。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5561":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-102","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#使用示例","content":"以下示例使用 `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` 和 `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`。请先导出在 快速开始 中创建的密钥对：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5562":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-103","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#range-请求","content":"Range 响应使用状态码 `206`，并包含 `Content-Range` 头。签名请求最简单的生成方式是使用 S3 SDK 或 AWS CLI。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5563":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-104","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#分片上传-1","content":"`AbortMultipartUpload` 尚未路由，因此放弃的上传会在临时存储目录中留下分片，需要手动清理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5564":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-105","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#单实例","content":"请通过进程管理工具（systemd、supervisor、Kubernetes）运行该二进制。目前尚未提供 start/stop 脚本：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5565":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-106","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"除临时分片数据和凭据外，网关是无状态的，因此可以部署在负载均衡之后：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5566":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-107","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"当网关实例多于一个时，请启用分布式分片存储和分布式凭据，使任意实例都能完成上传：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5567":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-108","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#多实例","content":"如果未启用分布式存储，分片会保留在接收该分片的实例本地 `put_temp_dir` 中；路由到其他实例的 `CompleteMultipartUpload` 将找不到这些分片。另一种方式是在负载均衡上配置会话保持。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5568":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-109","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#监控与日志","content":"网关通过 `tracing` 将日志输出到 stdout。可以使用 `RUST_LOG` 调整日志级别：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5569":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-110","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#监控与日志","content":"日志覆盖请求处理、认证失败、分片操作和文件系统错误。目前没有 metrics 端点；请使用 `/healthz` 端点进行存活检查。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5570":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-111","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"未实现 `CopyObject`；客户端需要先下载再重新上传。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5571":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-112","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"未实现 `AbortMultipartUpload`；放弃的上传会遗留临时分片。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5572":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-113","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"`ListObjectsV2` 只返回单页：`continuation-token` 和 `max-keys` 会被忽略，`is-truncated` 始终为 `false`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5573":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-114","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"接受条件请求头（`If-Match`、`If-None-Match`），但不会对其进行判断。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5574":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-115","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#限制","content":"启用 Curvine 回收站时，`DeleteObject` 和 `DeleteBucket` 会将数据移入回收站，而不是永久删除。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5575":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-116","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#端口被占用","content":"修改 `[s3_gateway]` 中的监听地址，或传入不同的 `--listen` 值：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5576":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-117","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#配置文件错误","content":"如果配置文件无法加载，网关会打印警告并继续使用默认配置。请检查路径和 TOML 语法：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5577":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-118","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#bucket-不存在","content":"上传前请先创建 bucket（`aws s3 mb`），网关不会隐式创建 bucket。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5578":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-119","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#性能调优","content":"对于大对象场景，可以提高 `get_chunk_size_mb`，并确保 `put_temp_dir` 位于快速本地存储上。当 `worker.enable_s3_gateway = true` 时，分片会直接写入 Curvine，不会使用 `put_temp_dir`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5579":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"page","content":"SDK 访问","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","接入方式"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","locale":"zh-cn"},"5580":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"概览","locale":"zh-cn"},"5581":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"Rust SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5582":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-sdk","content":"Java SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5583":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#python-sdk","content":"Python SDK","locale":"zh-cn"},"5584":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"通用配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"5585":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","content":"Curvine 提供多语言 SDK，使应用可通过 RPC 访问 Curvine 文件系统（元数据访问 Master，块数据访问 Worker），而无需使用 FUSE。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5586":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK      | 包 / 模块                              | 适用场景             |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| **Rust** | `curvine-client` / `curvine-libsdk` | 原生 Rust 应用、高性能场景 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5587":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK      | 包 / 模块                                                     | 适用场景                        |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **Java** | Hadoop 兼容 FileSystem（`fs.cv://`）、curvine-libsdk 的 Java SDK | Hadoop/Spark/Flink 等 JVM 应用 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5588":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"| SDK        | 包 / 模块                     | 适用场景          |\n| ---------- | -------------------------- | ------------- |\n| **Python** | curvine-libsdk 的 Python 绑定 | 机器学习、数据流水线、脚本 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5589":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#概览","content":"所有 SDK 均需在 Curvine 集群（Master 与 Worker）已启动、且客户端配置正确（如 `curvine-cluster.toml` 中的 `master_addrs`）的前提下使用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5590":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"通过 `curvine-client`（或 `curvine-libsdk` 暴露的 Rust API）编程式创建文件、读写数据、列举目录。配置通常从 `curvine-cluster.toml` 或环境变量加载。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5591":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-11","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#rust-sdk","content":"构建与用法参见 开发指南 及 Curvine 源码仓库（如 `curvine-client`、`curvine-libsdk` 及 `curvine-tests` 下的集成测试）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5592":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-sdk","content":"**Hadoop FileSystem**：在 `core-site.xml` 或 `curvine-site.xml` 中配置 `fs.cv.impl` 与 `fs.cv.default.master_addrs`，使 `FileSystem.get(URI.create(\"curvine:///path\"), conf)` 使用 Curvine。`fs.cv.default.master_addrs` 配置见 部署准备。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5593":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-sdk","content":"**Java API**：在不使用 Hadoop FileSystem 时，可使用 curvine-libsdk 的 Java SDK 直接通过 RPC 访问。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5594":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#java-sdk","content":"兼容 Hadoop、Spark、Flink 等支持自定义 FileSystem 的 JVM 框架。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5595":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#python-sdk","content":"Python SDK（来自 curvine-libsdk）提供读写文件、列举目录等原生 API，适用于 ML 训练、数据预处理和自动化脚本。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5596":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#python-sdk","content":"安装与示例见 Curvine 源码仓库及 开发指南。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5597":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"**Master 地址**：在集群配置（如 `curvine-cluster.toml`）中设置 `client.master_addrs`，或在各 SDK 中传入等价配置（如 Java 的 `fs.cv.default.master_addrs`）。格式：`host1:8995,host2:8995`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5598":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"**配置文件**：多数 SDK 支持传入配置文件路径（如 `conf/curvine-cluster.toml`），与 CLI（`cv`）、FUSE 共用同一配置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5599":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/sdk#通用配置","content":"若需 UFS（统一文件系统）访问，请先用 `cv mount` 挂载 UFS 路径；随后在对应 Curvine 路径上的 SDK 操作语义与 数据编排 一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5600":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","type":"page","content":"在 Deployment 中使用动态 PVC","breadcrumbs":["Documents","用户手册","K8S CSI 驱动"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","locale":"zh-cn"},"5601":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment#示例拓扑","content":"示例拓扑","locale":"zh-cn"},"5602":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment#storageclass-参数","content":"StorageClass 参数","locale":"zh-cn"},"5603":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment#应用示例","content":"应用示例","locale":"zh-cn"},"5604":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment#示例会创建什么","content":"示例会创建什么","locale":"zh-cn"},"5605":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Deployment#共享-pvc","content":"共享 PVC","locale":"zh-cn"},"5606":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/