rl":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework#静态-pv","content":"必填 `curvine-path`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5700":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework-55","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework#静态-pv","content":"静态 PV 不需要动态卷那种结构化 `volumeHandle`。如果没有显式提供 `fs-path`，当前 `node.go` 会先把它补成 `/`，再去生成 `mount-key`。这意味着静态 PV 的复用实际会退化为按 `master-addrs + /` 分组，除非你自己额外补上 `fs-path`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5701":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework-56","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework#静态-pv","content":"这个判断来自当前实现推断：`node.go` 在生成 `mount-key` 之前，确实会把缺失的 `fs-path` 替换为 `/`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5702":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework-57","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework#nodepublishvolume-如何定位-pod-子目录","content":"`pkg/csi/node.go` 中的 `NodePublishVolume` 会根据 FUSE 实际挂载的根路径来计算宿主机子路径：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5703":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework-58","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework#nodepublishvolume-如何定位-pod-子目录","content":"如果 `fs-path == /`，宿主机子路径就是 `mnt-path + curvine-path`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5704":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework-59","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework#nodepublishvolume-如何定位-pod-子目录","content":"如果 `fs-path != /`，宿主机子路径就是 `mnt-path + relative(curvine-path, fs-path)`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5705":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework-60","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/K8S-CSI-Driver/Framework","tags":[],"type":"text","