ine","content":"| 选项        | 说明                 |\n| --------- | ------------------ |\n| `--check` | 仅在列挂载点时生效，附带有效性检查。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6221":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-108","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"| 选项          | 说明                             |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `--dry-run` | `resync` 时只扫描和打印差异，不执行删除 / 创建。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6222":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-109","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"| 选项          | 说明                     |\n| ----------- | ---------------------- |\n| `--verbose` | `resync` 时打印更详细的逐文件日志。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-6"},"6223":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-110","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"**关于 `--provider`**：同一种 URI scheme 可能映射到不同实现。例如 `oss://...` 既可能走 OSS-HDFS / JindoSDK，也可能走 OpenDAL，因此可以通过 `--provider` 强制指定实现。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6224":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-111","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"| 取值     | 说明                   | 常见协议         |\n| ------ | -------------------- | ------------ |\n| `auto` | 按 URI scheme 自动选择实现。 | 所有已支持 scheme |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6225":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-112","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"| 取值         | 说明                         | 常见协议     |\n| ---------- | -------------------------- | -------- |\n| `oss-hdfs` | 使用 JindoSDK / OSS-HDFS 语义。 | `oss://` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6226":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-113","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"| 取值        | 说明             | 常见协议                                                                    |\n| --------- | -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `opendal` | 使用 OpenDAL 后端。 | `s3://`、`oss://`、`hdfs://`、`webhdfs://`、`cos://`、`gcs://`、`azblob://` 等 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6227":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-114","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"当前实现还有几个容易遗漏的行为：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6228":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-115","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"对 `s3://...` 路径，如果没有显式传 `s3.bucket_name`，CLI 会自动从 URI 提取并补全。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6229":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-116","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"对 `hdfs://...` 路径，如果没有显式传 `hdfs.namenode` / `hdfs.root`，CLI 会自动从 URI 推导。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6230":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-117","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"如果配置里出现 `hdfs.kerberos.*`，但既没有 `hdfs.kerberos.ccache`，环境里也没有 `KRB5CCNAME`，CLI 会打印 Kerberos ticket cache 警告。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6231":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-118","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"`validate_path_and_configs` 当前只对 S3 路径做额外格式校验；其它 scheme 主要依赖后续 provider 初始化和连通性检查。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6232":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-119","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6233":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-120","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"各 UFS 类型（S3、OSS、HDFS、WebHDFS）的常见参数列表见文末 附录：UFS 挂载参数。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6234":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-121","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"默认开启 `--check-path-consist=true`。因此像 `s3://bucket/datasets` 这样的 UFS 路径，通常需要挂载到 `/bucket/datasets`。如果确实需要不一致映射，请显式传 `--check-path-consist=false`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6235":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-122","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"当前源码里首次创建 `fs_mode` 挂载时会自动触发一次 `resync`。手动 `cv mount resync ...` 只适用于 `fs_mode` 挂载点。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6236":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-123","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#5-umount卸载挂载点","content":"**用法：** `cv umount <CURVINE_PATH>`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6237":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-124","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#5-umount卸载挂载点","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6238":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-125","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"**用法：** `cv load [OPTIONS] <SOURCE_PATH> [TARGET_PATH]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6239":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-126","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数         | 说明                                 |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `<SOURCE_PATH>` | UFS 源 URI，或已有 mount 下的 Curvine 路径。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-8"},"6240":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-127","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数         | 说明                             |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `[TARGET_PATH]` | 可选 Curvine 目标路径。已挂载源路径会自动推导目标。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-8"},"6241":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-128","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数       | 说明             |\n| ------------- | -------------- |\n| `-w, --watch` | 提交后立即持续观察任务状态。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-8"},"6242":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-129","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数          | 说明               |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- |\n| `--no-overwrite` | 目标已经存在时失败，不覆盖目标。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-8"},"6243":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-130","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6244":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-131","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"启用 Transfer 后，`load` 会提交 Transfer Job；否则使用旧 Master Job 路径。两种模式\n下命令都会输出 Job ID 和目标路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6245":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-132","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#transfer-路由","content":"启用独立 Transfer 后，命令行不变：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6246":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-133","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#transfer-路由","content":"| 客户端配置                        | `cv load` / `cv export` 路由   |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `[transfer] enabled = false` | 为兼容已有集群，调用旧 Master Load API。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"6247":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-134","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#transfer-路由","content":"| 客户端配置                       | `cv load` / `cv export` 路由 |\n| --------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `[transfer] enabled = true` | CLI 直接调用 Transfer 服务 RPC。  |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"6248":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-135","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#transfer-路由","content":"Transfer 服务和客户端都需要配置 Transfer。按客户端切换时无需修改 Master 和 Worker\n配置；`transfer.enabled = false` 的客户端会继续调用旧 Master API。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6249":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-136","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"**用法：** `cv export [OPTIONS] <PATH>`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6250":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-137","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"`<PATH>` 必须是一个挂载路径下的 Curvine 路径。Curvine 会根据挂载自动推导 UFS 目标路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6251":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-138","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"| 选项 / 参数  | 说明                |\n| -------- | ----------------- |\n| `<PATH>` | 要导出的 Curvine 源路径。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"6252":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-139","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"| 选项 / 参数       | 说明             |\n| ------------- | -------------- |\n| `-w, --watch` | 提交后立即持续观察任务状态。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"6253":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-140","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"| 选项 / 参数          | 说明            |\n| ---------------- | ------------- |\n| `--no-overwrite` | UFS 目标已存在时失败。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"6254":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-141","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6255":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-142","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#8-load-status查询加载任务状态","content":"**用法：** `cv load-status [OPTIONS] <JOB_ID>`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6256":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-143","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#8-load-status查询加载任务状态","content":"| 选项 / 参数    | 说明       |\n| ---------- | -------- |\n| `<JOB_ID>` | 加载任务 ID。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-11"},"6257":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-144","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#8-load-status查询加载任务状态","content":"| 选项 / 参数         | 说明    |\n| --------------- | ----- |\n| `-v, --verbose` | 详细输出。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-11"},"6258":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-145","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#8-load-status查询加载任务状态","content":"| 选项 / 参数                  | 说明                                  |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| `-w, --watch <INTERVAL>` | 轮询间隔，默认 `5s`。支持 `1s`、`1m`、`1h` 等格式。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-11"},"6259":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-146","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#8-load-status查询加载任务状态","content":"| 选项 / 参数         | 说明                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------ |\n| `--conf <PATH>` | 可选的单次配置覆盖；日常使用不需要。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-11"},"6260":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-147","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#8-load-status查询加载任务状态","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6261":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-148","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#8-load-status查询加载任务状态","content":"当前实现里 `load-status` 默认就会进入轮询模式，默认刷新间隔为 `5s`；源码暂未暴露“只查询一次然后退出”的独立开关。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6262":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-149","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#9-cancel-load取消加载任务","content":"**用法：** `cv cancel-load [OPTIONS] <JOB_ID>`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6263":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-150","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#9-cancel-load取消加载任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数    | 说明         |\n| ---------- | ---------- |\n| `<JOB_ID>` | 要取消的任务 ID。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"6264":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-151","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#9-cancel-load取消加载任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数         | 说明                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------ |\n| `--conf <PATH>` | 可选的单次配置覆盖；日常使用不需要。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"6265":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-152","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#9-cancel-load取消加载任务","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6266":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-153","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"`cv transfer` 仅在 `[transfer] enabled = true` 时可用。它用于列举、查看、重试和分页查询 Transfer 任务；日常提交仍使用 `cv load` 或 `cv export`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6267":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-154","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"该命令要求客户端配置可访问的 Transfer endpoint。服务部署见\nTransfer 服务。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6268":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-155","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                 | 说明                                                                    |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv transfer list` | 列出任务。可使用 `--kind load\\|export`、`--state`、`--tenant`、`--submitter` 过滤。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6269":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-156","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                            | 说明                                                          |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv transfer status <JOB_ID>` | 查看单个任务。使用 `--verbose` 查看任务明细，或用 `--watch --interval 1s` 轮询。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6270":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-157","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                           | 说明               |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `cv transfer tasks <JOB_ID>` | 查看单个任务的 task 分页。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6271":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-158","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                            | 说明                |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `cv transfer cancel <JOB_ID>` | 取消一个 Transfer 任务。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6272":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-159","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                           | 说明                     |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `cv transfer retry <JOB_ID>` | 将失败、取消或部分成功任务重试为一个新任务。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6273":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-160","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                    | 说明             |\n| --------------------- | -------------- |\n| `cv transfer tenants` | 按 tenant 汇总任务。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6274":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-161","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6275":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-162","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"`load-status` 与 `cancel-load` 仍保留为兼容命令。启用 Transfer 时它们调用 Transfer；关闭时调用旧 Master 实现。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6276":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-163","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-version查看版本","content":"**用法：** `cv version`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6277":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-164","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-version查看版本","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6278":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-165","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-version查看版本","content":"当前实现会输出 `curvine-cli <version>`，并带上 commit / branch 信息。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6279":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-166","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-version查看版本","content":"所有二进制还支持全局 `--version-json` 参数，以 JSON 形式输出完整结构化版本\n（组件名、发布版本、git 来源、协议版本、能力）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6280":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-167","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#12-bench内置基准测试","content":"**用法：** `cv bench [OPTIONS]`、`cv bench prefill [OPTIONS]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6281":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-168","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#12-bench内置基准测试","content":"`bench` 可对 `cv://` 路径（client 模式）或 `file://` 路径（FUSE 模式）运行元数据与吞吐量测试套件。`cv bench prefill` 用于为混合负载预置可复用的工作集。常用参数包括 `--path`、`--profile basic|deep`、`--mode auto|client|fuse`、`-p/--threads`、`--workload`、`--block-size`、`--big-file-size` 和 `--big-file-count`。完整参数请运行 `cv bench --help`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6282":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-169","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#13-fsck块副本健康检查","content":"**用法：** `cv fsck <PATH> [OPTIONS]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6283":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-170","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#13-fsck块副本健康检查","content":"| 参数       | 说明         |\n| -------- | ---------- |\n| `<PATH>` | 要检查的文件或目录。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"6284":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-171","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#13-fsck块副本健康检查","content":"| 参数         | 说明                |\n| ---------- | ----------------- |\n| `--detail` | 对目录输出每个文件与块的详细信息。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"6285":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-172","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#13-fsck块副本健康检查","content":"| 参数                     | 说明                                      |\n| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `--list-page-size <N>` | 每次列目录 RPC 返回的条目数（默认 `256`，范围 `1-4096`）。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"6286":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-173","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#13-fsck块副本健康检查","content":"`fsck` 会将每个块记录的副本与当前可用副本进行对比，报告副本不足的块和读取错误。扫描发现问题时会输出告警行。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6287":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-174","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"发行包里的 `bin/dfs` 是一个兼容包装器：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6288":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-175","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"当第一个子命令是 `fs` 或 `report` 时，它会调用 Java `io.curvine.CurvineShell`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6289":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-176","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"`dfs fs` 保留 Hadoop `FsShell` 风格，因此子命令写法是 `-ls`、`-mkdir`、`-rm -r` 这种单短横线形式。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6290":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-177","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"其它子命令最终仍会转发到 Rust `curvine-cli`，但日常运维建议直接使用 `cv`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6291":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-178","page_id":"/zh-cn/do